      "file": "app/lib/vault/store.rb",
      "line": 117,
      "note": "VACUUM INTO takes a file path and SQLite does not accept a bind parameter for it, so the path has to be interpolated. It is the operator's chosen backup destination, put through the adapter's own quote before it goes in. There is no version of this statement without interpolation; the alternative would be copying the file byte for byte while it is open, which is how a backup ends up half written."
