      "line": 135,
      "note": "ATTACH DATABASE ... KEY, used to re-key the vault by exporting it into a new file. Neither the path nor the key is bindable: SQLCipher parses the key out of the statement text itself. The path is generated here and quoted, and the key is a hex literal derived from the new passphrase — no part of either is text somebody typed."
    }
